Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A claim can sound convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But does the official voting booklet actually support it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the question behind Apertus Evidence Lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The OST challenge asks us to compare a claim with a Swiss voting booklet:\Nsupported, contradicted, or not established.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And the claim and document may be in different languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our starting point is a Jev-style approach: keep the language model frozen,\Nand train a small decision head on its internal representations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Apertus version one point five supplies those representations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We build the document pipeline around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Extract page text, combine keyword and multilingual semantic retrieval, and\Npack original passages into an eight-thousand-token context budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Production needs only the booklet and the claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We separate training and development validation by connected voting events.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:01:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We compare context budgets and test what happens with empty or wrong-event\Ndocuments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.55,0:01:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Performance drops support document dependence, with limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On two hundred seventy-six development examples, the best base configuration\Nscores point six seven two Macro F-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The original full-context head reaches point eight nine four.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our selected hybrid eight-K system reaches point nine four nine, and point\Nnine four two across languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That selected configuration uses about forty-three percent fewer prompt\Ntokens than the original full-context system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These are development results, not the organizer's hidden evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The interface returns a decision with inspectable source passages, page\Nnumbers, and downloadable results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those passages show the source context; they are not claimed as a validated\Nminimal proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Apertus Evidence Lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.45,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the source.
